# Presentation Layer — World-Class UI/UX Standards

> **Design system:** Khazna v3 — **Lapis Lux**. Canonical spec: `docs/design_system.md`.
> Every pixel is intentional. If a screen looks like "a Flutter demo app" or uses
> **blue-filled Material buttons**, it is a **CRITICAL DEFECT**. The bar is monochrome
> precision + lapis glow — not Material defaults.

## Layer Boundary

**PERMITTED:** `lib/domain/`, `lib/application/`, `package:flutter/*`, `package:riverpod/*`, `package:go_router/*`
**FORBIDDEN:** `package:drift/*`, `lib/data/*` — critical defect if present.

### Approved UI Packages

These packages are installed and MUST be used for their designated purpose. Do NOT use alternatives.

| Package | Role | Use For |
|---|---|---|
| `flutter_animate` | Declarative animations | Stagger entrances, fade/slide transitions, scale-down press, all §4 micro-interactions |
| `motor` | Spring physics | `curveSheetSpring`, toggles, glow breath, drag-return — style-agnostic; pair with `AppMotion` tokens. §7.3 |
| `figma_squircle` | Continuous corners | `SmoothRectangleBorder` / `ClipSmoothRect` on `DaftarCard`, `DaftarButton`, sheets — NOT Material `BorderRadius`. §5.1 |
| `flutter_slidable` | Swipe actions | Transaction list swipe-to-delete; `AppColors.debt` actions + `HapticService` at threshold. §7.4 |
| `animated_flip_counter` | Balance count-up | Hero balance with `duration: animationXSlow`, `curve: curveEmphasized`; wrap with `AppTextStyles.amount*`. §7.4 |
| `custom_refresh_indicator` | Pull-to-refresh | Lapis Arc indicator (`lapis400` stroke + `AppGlows.glowSm`) — never default `RefreshIndicator`. §7.4 |
| `skeletonizer` | Skeleton loading | Wrap real widgets with `Skeletonizer(enabled: isLoading)` — auto-generates shimmer. §6.4 |
| `lottie` | Rich animations | Empty state illustrations, branded loading art. Load from `assets/animations/`. §6.3 |
| `wolt_modal_sheet` | Premium bottom sheets | Multi-page flows, spring physics, drag-to-dismiss. Use instead of `showModalBottomSheet`. §7.3 |
| `gap` | Semantic spacing | `Gap(AppDimensions.spacingLg)` — axis-aware, replaces manual `SizedBox`. §10.2 |
| `flutter_svg` | Vector graphics | SVG illustrations and icons. §8.2 |

**Haptic feedback:** Use `HapticService` from `package:daftar/core/utils/haptic_service.dart` — NOT raw `HapticFeedback` except inside that service.

