## 10. THEME & DESIGN TOKENS

### 10.1 Token Files

| File | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `app_colors.dart` | Onyx/Bone monochrome, lapis scale, semantic debt/payment — **no gold/teal** |
| `app_glows.dart` | Lapis halos (`glowXs`–`glowXl`, `glowAmbient`, `ctaRest`) + light `shadowFloat` |
| `app_text_styles.dart` | Noto Kufi Arabic + Inter numeral scale with **tabular figures** |
| `app_dimensions.dart` | 8dp grid, radius, tap targets (≥48dp), animation durations |
| `app_motion.dart` | Curves (`curveEnter`, `curveEmphasized`, `curveSheetSpring`) |
| `app_theme.dart` | Material 3 shell; `NoSplash`; elevation 0 — depth via glows/borders |
| `haptic_service.dart` | Semantic haptics — use instead of raw `HapticFeedback` in widgets |

### 10.2 Token Discipline

- **Dark mode is DEFAULT** — optimized for OLED screens in the target market.
- ZERO inline `Color(0xFF...)`, `TextStyle(...)`, `EdgeInsets.all(...)` — everything through tokens.
- All tap targets ≥ `AppDimensions.minTapTarget` (48dp).
- Spacing follows the 8dp grid strictly — no arbitrary 5dp, 7dp, 13dp values.
- When a new token is needed, ADD it to the token file — never inline it.

---

## 11. LOCALIZATION

### 11.1 String Rules

- **ZERO hardcoded strings** in any widget. All user-facing text from ARB localization.
- All ARB keys use camelCase: `createLedger`, `emptyContactsMessage`, `deleteConfirmation`.
- Pluralization uses ICU syntax in ARB files.
- Number formatting uses `NumberFormat` with locale-aware separators.
- Date formatting uses locale-aware patterns (Hijri optional alongside Gregorian).

### 11.2 Layout Adaptation

- Buttons use intrinsic width — never fixed width that assumes one language's text length.
- Long Arabic text in headers uses `FittedBox(fit: BoxFit.scaleDown)` with a `minFontSize` guard.
- Tab bars use `isScrollable: true` when label lengths vary significantly between locales.
- All validation error messages are localized — never raw English error strings.

---

## 12. ACCESSIBILITY

- All interactive elements have `Semantics` labels in the active locale.
- Color is NEVER the sole indicator of state — always pair with icon, text, or pattern.
- Respect `MediaQuery.textScaleFactorOf(context)` — layouts must survive up to 1.5x scale.
- All tap targets meet WCAG 2.5.5 minimum (48dp × 48dp).
- Focus traversal order follows logical reading direction for the active locale.
- Screen reader labels for balance cards include currency and amount in natural language.

---

## 13. QUALITY GATES — REJECTION CRITERIA

A screen is NOT complete and MUST be rejected if ANY of the following is true:

| # | Rejection Criterion |
|---|---|
| 1 | Any `Color(0xFF...)` hardcoded outside `AppColors` |
| 2 | Any `TextStyle(...)` constructed inline outside `AppTextStyles` |
| 3 | Any `EdgeInsets.only(left:, right:)` instead of directional equivalents |
| 4 | Any `TextAlign.left` or `TextAlign.right` |
| 5 | Missing shimmer skeleton for any async data load |
| 6 | A blank screen during initial load (no loading state) |
| 7 | `CircularProgressIndicator()` as the primary loading indicator |
| 8 | Hardcoded user-facing string not from ARB |
| 9 | Missing haptic feedback on transaction save, delete, or PIN press |
| 10 | Tap target < 48dp on any interactive element |
| 11 | Missing entrance animation on list screens |
| 12 | Default unstyled Material `Card`, `ListTile`, `AlertDialog`, or `SnackBar` |
| 13 | Repository called directly from a provider (bypassing Use Case) |
| 14 | `Drift` import in any presentation file |
| 15 | Non-directional icon that should flip in RTL |
| 16 | Balance amount using Arabic font instead of Inter numeral styles |
| 17 | Missing empty state when data list is empty |
| 18 | Missing error state with retry action for fallible operations |
| 19 | `ListView(children: [...])` for any dynamic list |
| 20 | Missing `const` constructor on stateless widgets that support it |
| 21 | **Lapis used as fill** on card/button/FAB/chip (info banner excepted) |
| 22 | **More than ONE** lapis-glow moment on a single visible screen |
| 23 | `FilledButton` / `ElevatedButton` with `backgroundColor: lapis400` or `colorScheme.primary` blue fill |
| 24 | `darkPrimary`, `darkAccent`, `darkSurface`, or any **deprecated** `AppColors` alias |
| 25 | Gold, brass, teal, or indigo anywhere in presentation |
| 26 | Dark-mode card with Material `elevation` drop-shadow instead of Khazna Float |
